+## Keys and roles
+
+Every request carries `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are in the data
+(`docs/DATA.md`). A missing or unknown key is 401 `unauthorized`, on any path;
+a known key without permission is 403 `forbidden`.
+
+- `viewer`: every `GET` route except `GET /audit`.
+- `cook`: what `viewer` may, plus `POST /recipes/:id/cook`,
+  `POST /batches/:id/waste`, `POST /temperatures` and
+  `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: every route. Routes that change data are for managers unless
+  listed above.
+
+## Audit
+
+`GET /audit` (managers only) lists the requests that changed data, newest first:
+
+    [{ "id": 1, "at": "2026-10-28T10:00:00.000Z", "keyName": "dev-cook", "method": "POST", "path": "/recipes/1/cook", "status": 200 }]
+
+`path` has no query string. Requests that were refused or failed change nothing
+and are not listed.
+
